<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Normandy extends NFM offer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Normandy extends NFM offer.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Normandy Mining Ltd said on Friday that it had Extended its takeovEr offer for North Flinders Mines Ltd by one month to November 4.</p>
<p>Normandy's offer is 425 Normandy shares for every 100 North Flinders shares. The offer was launched in June as part of a rationalisation of the Normandy group, which sees Gold Mines of Kalgoorlie Ltd and Posgold Ltd.</p>
<p>Normandy said it now held 73.47 percent of North Flinders.</p>
<p>At 3.15 p.m. (0515 GMT), North Flinders Shares were 25 cents up at A$8.30.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
